{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PsHkgnFmHEASTakozmjXSr","type":"tool_result","content":"760\t  }\n761\t}\n762\t\n763\t/* ============================================================\n764\t   Styled Native Select with appearance: base-select (US-188)\n765\t   Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+, Firefox future.\n766\t   @supports fallback for browsers without appearance: base-select.\n767\t   Retains built-in accessibility (keyboard, screen reader).\n768\t   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/a-customizable-select\n769\t   ============================================================ */\n770\t@supports (appearance: base-select) {\n771\t  select.select-base {\n772\t    appearance: base-select;\n773\t    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n774\t    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n775\t    background-color: var(--color-stone-50, #fafaf9);\n776\t    color: var(--color-stone-900, #1c1917);\n777\t    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n778\t    font-size: 0.875rem;\n779\t    line-height: 1.5;\n780\t    font-family: inherit;\n781\t    cursor: pointer;\n782\t    transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, background-color 0.2s ease-out;\n783\t  }\n784\t\n785\t  select.select-base:hover {\n786\t    border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n787\t  }\n788\t\n789\t  select.select-base:focus-visible {\n790\t    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n791\t    outline-offset: 2px;\n792\t  }\n793\t\n794\t  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n795\t    select.select-base {\n796\t      background-color: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n797\t      color: var(--color-stone-100, #f5f5f4);\n798\t      border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n799\t    }\n800\t\n801\t    select.select-base:hover {\n802\t      border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n803\t    }\n804\t\n805\t    select.select-base:focus-visible {\n806\t      outline-color: var(--color-amber-400, #fbbf24);\n807\t    }\n808\t  }\n809\t\n810\t  @media (prefers-contrast: more) {\n811\t    select.select-base {\n812\t      border-width: 2px;\n813\t      border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n814\t    }\n815\t\n816\t    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n817\t      select.select-base {\n818\t        border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n819\t      }\n820\t    }\n821\t  }\n822\t\n823\t  @media (forced-colors: active) {\n824\t    select.select-base {\n825\t      border: 1px solid ButtonText;\n826\t      background-color: ButtonFace;\n827\t      color: ButtonText;\n828\t      forced-color-adjust: none;\n829\t    }\n830\t\n831\t    select.select-base:hover {\n832\t      background-color: Highlight;\n833\t      color: HighlightText;\n834\t    }\n835\t  }\n836\t}\n837\t\n838\t/* Custom scrollbar */\n839\t::-webkit-scrollbar {\n840\t  width: 8px;\n841\t}\n842\t\n843\t::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n844\t  @apply bg-stone-100;\n845\t}\n846\t\n847\t::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n848\t  @apply bg-stone-300 rounded-full;\n849\t}\n850\t\n851\t::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n852\t  @apply bg-stone-400;\n853\t}\n854\t\n855\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n856\t  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n857\t    background-color: #1c1917;\n858\t  }\n859\t  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed72d350-820b-4f7d-bbc7-332537a10136","uuid":"755c8dd4-49ee-46a0-bc09-c02bc0c239f8","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:47:16.660Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","content":"  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Styled Native Select with appearance: base-select (US-188)\n   Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+, Firefox future.\n   @supports fallback for browsers without appearance: base-select.\n   Retains built-in accessibility (keyboard, screen reader).\n   Reference: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/a-customizable-select\n   ============================================================ */\n@supports (appearance: base-select) {\n  select.select-base {\n    appearance: base-select;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n    background-color: var(--color-stone-50, #fafaf9);\n    color: var(--color-stone-900, #1c1917);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, background-color 0.2s ease-out;\n  }\n\n  select.select-base:hover {\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n  }\n\n  select.select-base:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    select.select-base {\n      background-color: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n      color: var(--color-stone-100, #f5f5f4);\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-600, #57534e);\n    }\n\n    select.select-base:hover {\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n    }\n\n    select.select-base:focus-visible {\n      outline-color: var(--color-amber-400, #fbbf24);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-contrast: more) {\n    select.select-base {\n      border-width: 2px;\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n      select.select-base {\n        border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (forced-colors: active) {\n    select.select-base {\n      border: 1px solid ButtonText;\n      background-color: ButtonFace;\n      color: ButtonText;\n      forced-color-adjust: none;\n    }\n\n    select.select-base:hover {\n      background-color: Highlight;\n      color: HighlightText;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* Custom scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  @apply bg-stone-100;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  @apply bg-stone-300 rounded-full;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  @apply bg-stone-400;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background-color: #1c1917;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {","numLines":100,"startLine":760,"totalLines":895}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01B19AFiBCWDVdVH7uTVstMG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! I can see that US-188 has already been implemented! The code is in place:\n\n1. ✅ Line 764: Comment referencing US-188\n2. ✅ Line 770: `@supports (appearance: base-select)` guard for progressive enhancement\n3. ✅ Lines 771-836: Full CSS styling for `.select-base` with:\n   - `appearance: base-select`\n   - Brand design system colors (stone palette)\n   - Border-radius matching design system\n   - Light and dark mode support\n   - Reduced motion support\n   - High contrast support\n   - Forced colors support\n\n4. ✅ LanguageSwitcher.tsx uses `<select>` with `className=\"select-base\"` \n5. ✅ BookingForm.tsx uses `<select>` with `className=\"select-base\"`\n\nThe implementation already covers:\n- ✅ Criterion 1: Language switcher and filter dropdowns use `<select>` with `appearance: base-select`\n- ✅ Criterion 2: Styled select matches brand design system (border-radius, colors, font)\n- ✅ Criterion 3: `@supports (appearance: base-select)` guard ensures progressive enhancement\n- ✅ Criterion 4: Native select retains keyboard and screen reader support (no custom radix component)\n\nThe story was marked as `_skipped: true` because the feature was experimental at the time, but it appears someone already implemented it. According to the progress.txt pattern from US-143, when code is already committed, we just need to verify it and mark `passes: true`.\n\nLet me verify by running quality checks to make sure everything is correct.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1332,"cache_read_input_tokens":66035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1332},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_