{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QULY4zbipSTXaMRoy99XCk","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 44f833e04f3bf1666f3fc466961ce4c2a4e49e91\nAuthor: wenjyue84 <wenjyue@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Apr 14 13:54:03 2026 +0800\n\n    feat(US-188): Adopt CSS appearance: base-select for styled native select elements\n    \n    - Added CSS for styled native select elements using appearance: base-select property\n    - Wrapped in @supports guard for progressive enhancement (Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+)\n    - Styled select matches brand design system: border-radius 0.75rem, stone color palette\n    - Updated BookingForm.tsx to use new select-base class for room type dropdown\n    - Includes dark mode, high contrast, and forced-colors mode support\n    - Retains native accessibility semantics (keyboard navigation, screen reader support)\n    \n    Story ID: US-188\n    Acceptance criteria met:\n    - [x] Native select elements styled with appearance: base-select\n    - [x] Styled select matches brand design system\n    - [x] @supports guard ensures progressive enhancement\n    - [x] No regression in WCAG 4.1.2 accessibility\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n site/src/app/globals.css            | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n site/src/components/BookingForm.tsx |  4 +-\n 2 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\n[rerun: b26]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed72d350-820b-4f7d-bbc7-332537a10136","uuid":"476523c0-096f-4d93-85e4-abd7177820f7","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:55:18.506Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit 44f833e04f3bf1666f3fc466961ce4c2a4e49e91\nAuthor: wenjyue84 <wenjyue@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Apr 14 13:54:03 2026 +0800\n\n    feat(US-188): Adopt CSS appearance: base-select for styled native select elements\n    \n    - Added CSS for styled native select elements using appearance: base-select property\n    - Wrapped in @supports guard for progressive enhancement (Chrome 130+, Safari 18.3+)\n    - Styled select matches brand design system: border-radius 0.75rem, stone color palette\n    - Updated BookingForm.tsx to use new select-base class for room type dropdown\n    - Includes dark mode, high contrast, and forced-colors mode support\n    - Retains native accessibility semantics (keyboard navigation, screen reader support)\n    \n    Story ID: US-188\n    Acceptance criteria met:\n    - [x] Native select elements styled with appearance: base-select\n    - [x] Styled select matches brand design system\n    - [x] @supports guard ensures progressive enhancement\n    - [x] No regression in WCAG 4.1.2 accessibility\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n site/src/app/globals.css            | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n site/src/components/BookingForm.tsx |  4 +-\n 2 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
